msgid "Standard OpenVPN (UDP/TCP) and WireGuard configurations are fully supported with high performance. Please note that Windscribe \"Stealth\" (TLS encapsulation over TCP 443 via Stunnel) and \"WStunnel\" (WebSocket encapsulation) require proprietary wrapper binaries not included in standard OpenWrt."
